menuconfig DRIVERS_ESC_4WAY
	bool "esc_4way (MSP and 4way ESC configuration server over USB or a serial port)"
	default n
	depends on SERIALPASSTHROUGH_BITBANG
	---help---
		Serves the BLHeli/AM32 4way interface protocol to ESC configurators
		(am32.ca, esc-configurator.com) through the flight controller: MSP on
		the host side, the ESC bootloader protocol on the ESC signal pins via
		the bit-bang UART backend. Started by cdcacm_autostart when
		PASSTHRU_EN=2 or by "esc_4way start -d <device>". The outputs are
		stopped for the session and the board reboots afterwards.
